Night of Wednesday 16 September. The first report landed at 03:19: somebody on `sched-prod`
saying their Thursday shifts had moved by an hour. After that they didn't stop.
By the time the queue went quiet the desk had **412 reports**.

**All 412 are one issue.** Tove merged them into #4471 under the
[triage rule](/kb/triage/dedupe), one at a time. Engineering shipped the fix, change #29,
at 06:15, and the queue stopped growing.

<Callout>
Closed. One issue, one fix, no follow-ups.
</Callout>

